@startuml
actor 学生
participant "前端 CourseSelect" as Web
participant "CourseSelectionController" as Controller
participant "CourseSelectionService" as Service
database "MySQL" as DB

学生 -> Web: 点击选课
Web -> Controller: POST /api/course-selections/select
Controller -> Service: selectCourse(studentId, teachingClassId)
Service -> DB: 查询教学班和课程状态
Service -> DB: 检查重复选课
Service -> DB: 检查容量
Service -> DB: 检查时间冲突
Service -> DB: 插入选课记录
Service -> DB: 更新已选人数
Service --> Controller: 选课结果
Controller --> Web: success
@enduml
